id=mirafix
name=Mirafix—解决投屏
version=v1.3
versionCode=4
author=Petittux
description=修复小米/HyperOS 原生投屏 1008 报错（HyperCeiler 截屏开关/FLAG_SECURE 冲突导致 secure buffer → qbuf -22）。Fixes the stock Miracast 1008 error on HyperOS (secure buffer → qbuf -22) by patching libsurfaceflinger on-device; auto-detects model & OS, works with Magisk/Alpha and KernelSU.
